WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.660
Guest lists: guest lists, invitations, RSVPs, meal choices and QR check-in.

2
00:00:09.206 --> 00:00:14.840
Choose the event; add guests with "Add guest" or "Import CSV".

3
00:00:15.392 --> 00:00:24.530
Send invitations with "Send the invitation in the chat" or "Copy invitation link"; replies and meals are recorded automatically.

4
00:00:25.078 --> 00:00:33.510
On the day, give the team the "Door link for the team (scan QR with a phone)" so they scan guests' QR codes by phone.

5
00:00:34.059 --> 00:00:39.200
Give the door link only to the team; if it leaks, make a "New door link".
